# RDF Time Series Sources (TSS)
Header set Access-Control-Allow-Origin *
Header set Access-Control-Allow-Headers DNT,X-Mx-ReqToken,Keep-Alive,User-Agent,X-Requested-With,If-Modified$
Options +FollowSymLinks
RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^specification$ https://knowledgeonwebscale.github.io/rdf-tss/ [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^.*$ https://knowledgeonwebscale.github.io/rdf-tss/tss.ttl [R=303,L]
